<programme start="20261103111400 +0000" stop="20261103120000 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">True Crime Story</title><sub-title lang="en">It Couldn&apos;t Happen Here: Adel, Georgia</sub-title><desc lang="en">The town of Adel, Ga., is rocked by a brutal robbery homicide, and locals quickly point to an outsider as the killer; over 20 years later, new evidence raises the startling question if an innocent man is serving life for another man&apos;s crime.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20427808_b_v12_am.jpg"/></programme>
