<programme start="20261104103200 +0000" stop="20261104120400 +0000" channel="Indie Plex (East)"><title lang="en">All Creatures Here Below</title><desc lang="en">Desperate for money, Gensan and Ruby impulsively commit a crime which sets in motion a series of dire events. Now on the run, the couple seek refuge in Kansas City, Mo., a place filled with dark secrets that still haunt them.</desc><credits><actor>David Dastmalchian</actor><actor>Karen Gillan</actor><actor>David Koechner</actor></credits><date>20180101</date><category lang="en">Movies</category><category lang="en">Drama</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p16726970_p_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
